  body: 'NORTHPOINT RADIO - VISITOR LOG

    STORM NIGHT - 14 OCTOBER


    23:10  IN   Maya R. (staff family)

    23:10  IN   Alex R. (staff family)

    02:47  OUT  Alex R.

    --:--  OUT  Maya R.  ________


    The last line was never signed.'
